WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:05.339
Kia ora, two weeks on from lockdown. 
Just checking in with you and those in your

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:10.980
bubble to see that you're doing okay.
A few things to update you on.

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:16.260
Last week I  talked about the coming rates
installment, we understand that people

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:22.140
are facing an uncertain financial future.
If you have any concerns about paying

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:27.240
this, please be in touch with us. We have
many options that we can look at to

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:33.030
support you including deferral and we
welcome that opportunity to discuss that

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:38.680
with you and tailor a package directly
to you that will help you through this period.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:44.160
Last week, Council's Emergency
Operations Center was stood up. The whole

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:48.390
purpose of this is to support people
through this time and connect you with

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:53.670
relevant organisations, so if there's
anyone that you know of that needs

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:58.320
support including yourself, please be in
contact with us our number is:

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:05.100
0800 965 468, as I say, we're here to help.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:10.619
As Mayor and Councillors, we're concerned about the
rates for the coming years and we've

00:01:10.619 --> 00:01:15.060
asked our staff, particularly in these
uncertain times, to have another look at

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:20.640
our budgets and identify where there can
be savings.  Next week we're having a

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:25.170
workshop, we will be discussing these
with staff and then in the coming weeks

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:29.380
expect to be able to communicate with
you our thinking.

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:35.579
We're coming into Easter, all I'd like to say to you is make sure that you enjoy the long

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:40.780
weekend. Take the opportunity to spend
that time with those in your bubble.

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:48.140
Connect with your families. Do stay calm,
please stay home, follow the rules,

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:52.780
be kind and take care of each other.
Happy Easter!

